h。上市29分钟大定破1万台，高端版占比95.6%。</section><section style=\"margin-top: 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\"><section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\"><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.5; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.2; border-radius: 1px;\"></section></section><section style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #0052d9; font-weight: 700; opacity: 0.85; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;\">SYS.ACTIVE</section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0 0 35px 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 82, 217, 0.08); border-top: 5px solid #0052d9; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 24px 20px 20px 20px;\"><section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><section style=\"background-color: #0052d9; color: #ffffff; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 3px; letter-spacing: 1px; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.2;\">CORE 02</section><section style=\"margin-left: 12px; flex: 1; height: 1px; background-color: rgba(0, 82, 217, 0.15);\"></section></section><section style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 900; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">1313 公里雷军全程直播！新一代小米 SU7 成功实现满电出发，中间只充一次电从北京到上海</section></section><section style=\"width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 0; background-color: #ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-product-hub/main/data/images/b575c4893b5156825faebbd7a7fb4b5a.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; max-height: 600px; height: auto; border: none; object-fit: cover; object-position: top;\" /></section><section style=\"padding: 24px 20px 30px 20px;\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #3f3f3f; line-height: 1.85; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 0.8px; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\">雷军于4月17日早上6:35开始直播，驾驶小米SU7 Pro从北京出发，满电启动，全程仅中途充电一次，历时15小时行驶1313公里，抵达上海金桥小米5G未来中心工区时剩余续航19公里。途中他在S2沪芦高速康桥收费站下高速，曾与李肖爽续行至约1300公里，途中在星巴克喝咖啡吃早点，因围观人多仅随便吃了一顿。雷军表示此次测试验证了长续航能力，并称超快充目前布局不足，边际效应不明显。</section><section style=\"margin-top: 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\"><section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\"><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.5; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.2; border-radius: 1px;\"></section></section><section style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #0052d9; font-weight: 700; opacity: 0.85; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;\">SYS.ACTIVE</section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0 0 35px 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 82, 217, 0.08); border-top: 5px solid #0052d9; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 24px 20px 20px 20px;\"><section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><section style=\"background-color: #0052d9; color: #ffffff; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 3px; letter-spacing: 1px; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.2;\">CORE 03</section><section style=\"margin-left: 12px; flex: 1; height: 1px; background-color: rgba(0, 82, 217, 0.15);\"></section></section><section style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 900; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">37.18 万元起，长城旗下归元 S 平台首款车型魏牌 V9X 开启预售</section></section><section style=\"padding: 0 20px 30px 20px;\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #3f3f3f; line-height: 1.85; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 0.8px; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\">长城旗下魏牌 V9X 是基于归元 S 平台的首款车型，定位“AI 豪华六座旗舰”，采用超级 Hi4 混动系统（2.0T 发动机+4挡混动专用变速箱+800V 高压架构），支持 6C 超充，0-100km/h 加速 4.4秒。车辆提供豪华家庭版、豪华加长版、行政加长版三种配置，预售价起步价 37.18万元（豪华加长版），豪华家庭版 38.18万元，行政加长版 41.18万元。外观采用东方经典建筑美学，星环式贯穿灯带、发光悬浮车标、贯穿式尾灯；内部双联屏、零重力二排座椅带腿托、后排吸顶娱乐屏、小桌板及三排按摩功能。底盘配备自研大角度后轮转向及闭式双腔空气悬架。该车标轴版长度 5205mm，轴距 3050mm，宽高与长轴版一致。</section><section style=\"margin-top: 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\"><section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\"><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.5; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.2; border-radius: 1px;\"></section></section><section style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #0052d9; font-weight: 700; opacity: 0.85; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;\">SYS.ACTIVE</section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0 0 35px 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 82, 217, 0.08); border-top: 5px solid #0052d9; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 24px 20px 20px 20px;\"><section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><section style=\"background-color: #0052d9; color: #ffffff; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 3px; letter-spacing: 1px; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.2;\">CORE 04</section><section style=\"margin-left: 12px; flex: 1; height: 1px; ba